From: Senemos Maintainers <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: declare Qt QML imports exported by current KF6 I18n

KF6 I18n 6.31 exports I18nQml with a Qt6::QmlIntegration interface. Declare
the QML targets before importing KF6 instead of relying on another dependency
to create them incidentally. Observed on Fedora Rawhide AArch64 COPR 11075055.

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -27,4 +27,6 @@ find_package(Qt6 CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS
     Widgets
     DBus
+    Qml
+    QmlIntegration
 )
 find_package(KF6 REQUIRED COMPONENTS I18n)
